msgid ""
"Quick period selector. MTD/QTD/YTD run from the start of the current "
"month/quarter/fiscal year through today. The Last variants cover the most "
"recently completed period. Custom unlocks Date From and Date To for free "
"entry."
msgstr ""
"Selector rápido de período. MTD/QTD/YTD abarcan desde el inicio del "
